<div id="kycModal" class="modal kyc-modal hidden"><div class="modal-box">
<div class="section-title"><div><h3>Shareholder & Nominee KYC</h3><span class="muted">Step-by-step • Mobile friendly • Camera + Gallery</span></div><button class="secondary" onclick="closeKyc()">×</button></div>
<div class="kyc-note"><b>KYC ৬টি ছোট ধাপে পূরণ করুন।</b> প্রতিটি ধাপে <b>Next</b> চাপলে পরের অংশে যাবেন। ছবি দিতে Camera অথবা Gallery—দুই option-ই থাকবে। Image document crop সম্পূর্ণ free-size; NID-এর জন্য fixed ratio নেই এবং TIN/Passport-এর A4 অনুপাতও নষ্ট হবে না।</div>
<div id="kycStepper" class="stepper"></div>
<div id="kycStep1" class="kyc-step active"><div class="step-card"><div class="step-title">১. Shareholder Basic Information</div><div class="step-sub">নিজের পরিচয় ও পারিবারিক তথ্য</div><div class="kyc-grid"><div><label>Member ID</label><input id="kycMemberId" readonly></div><div><label>Shareholder Name</label><input id="kycMemberName" placeholder="Shareholder full name"></div><div><label>Father Name *</label><input id="kycFather" placeholder="Father's full name"></div><div><label>Mother Name *</label><input id="kycMother" placeholder="Mother's full name"></div><div><label>Spouse Name</label><input id="kycSpouse"></div><div><label>Date of Birth *</label><input id="kycDob" type="date"></div><div><label>Marital Status</label><select id="kycMarital"><option value="">Select</option><option>Single</option><option>Married</option><option>Widowed</option><option>Divorced</option></select></div><div><label>Profession *</label><input id="kycProfession"></div></div></div><div class="step-actions"><span></span><button onclick="nextKycStep()">Next →</button></div></div>
<div id="kycStep2" class="kyc-step"><div class="step-card"><div class="step-title">২. Address & Contact</div><div class="step-sub">বর্তমান ও স্থায়ী ঠিকানা এবং যোগাযোগ</div><div class="kyc-grid"><div class="full"><label>Present Address *</label><textarea id="kycPresent"></textarea></div><div class="full"><label>Permanent Address *</label><textarea id="kycPermanent"></textarea></div><div><label>Bangladesh Phone *</label><input id="kycBdPhone" inputmode="tel"></div><div><label>WhatsApp Number</label><input id="kycWhatsapp" inputmode="tel"></div><div><label>Overseas Phone</label><input id="kycOverseasPhone" inputmode="tel"></div><div><label>Email</label><input id="kycEmail" type="email"></div></div></div><div class="step-actions"><button class="secondary" onclick="prevKycStep()">← Back</button><button onclick="nextKycStep()">Next →</button></div></div>
<div id="kycStep3" class="kyc-step"><div class="step-card"><div class="step-title">৩. NID & Other Information</div><div class="step-sub">জাতীয় পরিচয়পত্র, TIN ও Passport নম্বর</div><div class="kyc-grid"><div><label>Shareholder NID Number *</label><input id="kycNid"></div><div><label>TIN Number</label><input id="kycTin"></div><div><label>Passport Number</label><input id="kycPassport"></div></div></div><div class="step-actions"><button class="secondary" onclick="prevKycStep()">← Back</button><button onclick="nextKycStep()">Next →</button></div></div>
<div id="kycStep4" class="kyc-step"><div class="step-card"><div class="step-title">৪. Shareholder Documents</div><div class="step-sub">NID, TIN, Passport ও নিজের ছবি</div><div class="kyc-grid"><div class="filebox"><label>NID Front *</label><div class="upload-choice"><button onclick="pickCamera('kycShareNidFront')">📷 Camera</button><button class="secondary" onclick="pickGallery('kycShareNidFront')">🖼 Gallery</button></div><input id="kycShareNidFront" type="file" accept="image/*" hidden><div id="previewShareNidFront" class="upload-preview"></div></div><div class="filebox"><label>NID Back *</label><div class="upload-choice"><button onclick="pickCamera('kycShareNidBack')">📷 Camera</button><button class="secondary" onclick="pickGallery('kycShareNidBack')">🖼 Gallery</button></div><input id="kycShareNidBack" type="file" accept="image/*" hidden><div id="previewShareNidBack" class="upload-preview"></div></div><div class="filebox"><label>Shareholder Photo *</label><div class="upload-choice"><button onclick="pickCamera('kycMemberPhoto','user')">📷 Camera</button><button class="secondary" onclick="pickGallery('kycMemberPhoto')">🖼 Gallery</button></div><input id="kycMemberPhoto" type="file" accept="image/*" hidden><div id="previewMemberPhoto" class="upload-preview"></div></div><div class="filebox"><label>TIN Certificate</label><div class="upload-choice"><button onclick="pickCamera('kycTinFile')">📷 Camera</button><button class="secondary" onclick="pickGallery('kycTinFile')">🖼 Gallery</button></div><input id="kycTinFile" type="file" accept="image/*,.pdf" hidden><div id="previewTinFile" class="upload-preview"></div></div><div class="filebox"><label>Passport Copy</label><div class="upload-choice"><button onclick="pickCamera('kycPassportFile')">📷 Camera</button><button class="secondary" onclick="pickGallery('kycPassportFile')">🖼 Gallery</button></div><input id="kycPassportFile" type="file" accept="image/*,.pdf" hidden><div id="previewPassportFile" class="upload-preview"></div></div></div></div><div class="step-actions"><button class="secondary" onclick="prevKycStep()">← Back</button><button onclick="nextKycStep()">Next →</button></div></div>
<div id="kycStep5" class="kyc-step"><div class="step-card"><div class="step-title">৫. Nominee Information</div><div class="step-sub">Nominee-এর পরিচয় ও যোগাযোগ</div><div class="kyc-grid"><div><label>Nominee Name *</label><input id="kycNomineeName"></div><div><label>Nominee NID *</label><input id="kycNomineeNid"></div><div><label>Nominee Date of Birth *</label><input id="kycNomineeDob" type="date"></div><div><label>Nominee Relation *</label><input id="kycNomineeRelation"></div><div><label>Nominee Phone</label><input id="kycNomineePhone" inputmode="tel"></div><div class="full"><label>Nominee Address</label><textarea id="kycNomineeAddress"></textarea></div></div></div><div class="step-actions"><button class="secondary" onclick="prevKycStep()">← Back</button><button onclick="nextKycStep()">Next →</button></div></div>
<div id="kycStep6" class="kyc-step"><div class="step-card"><div class="step-title">৬. Nominee Documents & Final Submit</div><div class="step-sub">Nominee NID, photo এবং final confirmation</div><div class="kyc-grid"><div class="filebox"><label>Nominee NID Front *</label><div class="upload-choice"><button onclick="pickCamera('kycNomNidFront')">📷 Camera</button><button class="secondary" onclick="pickGallery('kycNomNidFront')">🖼 Gallery</button></div><input id="kycNomNidFront" type="file" accept="image/*" hidden><div id="previewNomNidFront" class="upload-preview"></div></div><div class="filebox"><label>Nominee NID Back *</label><div class="upload-choice"><button onclick="pickCamera('kycNomNidBack')">📷 Camera</button><button class="secondary" onclick="pickGallery('kycNomNidBack')">🖼 Gallery</button></div><input id="kycNomNidBack" type="file" accept="image/*" hidden><div id="previewNomNidBack" class="upload-preview"></div></div><div class="filebox"><label>Nominee Photo *</label><div class="upload-choice"><button onclick="pickCamera('kycNomineePhoto','user')">📷 Camera</button><button class="secondary" onclick="pickGallery('kycNomineePhoto')">🖼 Gallery</button></div><input id="kycNomineePhoto" type="file" accept="image/*" hidden><div id="previewNomineePhoto" class="upload-preview"></div></div><div class="full"><label>Additional Information / Notes</label><textarea id="kycNotes"></textarea></div></div><div class="kyc-note" style="margin-top:12px">⚠️ Submit করার পর KYC locked থাকবে। পরে পরিবর্তন দরকার হলে Profile থেকে Admin-এর কাছে Update Request পাঠাতে হবে। Admin approve করলে আবার এই form-এ update করা যাবে।</div></div><div id="kycMsg" class="login-msg"></div><div class="step-actions"><button class="secondary" onclick="prevKycStep()">← Back</button><button class="kyc-btn" onclick="submitKyc()">✓ Submit KYC</button></div></div>
</div></div>
